# Keep secrets/notebooks/caches OUT of the image.
# NOTE: this Dockerfile is single-stage (COPY . .), so without this file the .env
# (OLLAMA_API_KEY) would be baked into the published image. OLLAMA_API_KEY is supplied
# at runtime via docker-compose `env_file`, so it is not needed inside the image.
.git/
.gitignore
.env
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.ipynb
*.log
